---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
import { PROFILE } from "../data/profile";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="lg:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="about-copy">
    <p>I work at the intersection of customer experience, professional services, and technology.</p>
    <p>My focus is solution design, CRM implementation, support automation, and leading projects from scoping to delivery.</p>
    <h3>Engineering foundation</h3>
    <p>{PROFILE.education}<br /><span>{PROFILE.university}</span></p>
    <h3>How I work</h3>
    <p>Clear stakeholder communication, Agile delivery, and practical guidance that helps teams adopt the solutions we build.</p>
    <a href="/blog#education">Education & skills →</a>
  </div>
</Card>

<style>
  .about-copy { color: #c3c3c3; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  p { margin: .9rem 0; }
  h3 { margin: 1.25rem 0 .25rem; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 700; color: #f5f5f5; }
  span { color: #a3a3a3; }
  a { color: var(--color-primary-500); text-underline-offset: .25rem; }
</style>
